flowchart LR
    A([Start]) --> B[/Admin, HR, or Employee uses browser/]
    B --> C[Static HTML and JavaScript]
    C --> D{Client-side role check passes?}
    D -- No --> E[/Redirect to login/]
    E --> Z([End])
    D -- Yes --> F[Run payroll, attendance, leave, or admin logic]
    F --> G[(Browser localStorage)]
    G --> H{Sync library connected?}
    H -- No --> I[/Only this browser sees change/]
    H -- Yes --> J[Publish whole key/value]
    J --> K[(Public MQTT broker/topic)]
    K --> L[Other client accepts update]
    L --> G
    I --> Z
